                        "entry_id": "2605fdc2-8b47-3316-a596-d30bee00ac7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "учебное устройство для тренажа, то есть для выработки навыков управления какой-либо машиной или каким-либо механизмом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88b9f851-473c-3067-ba54-d27dfa997e48",
                        "entry_id": "2605fdc2-8b47-3316-a596-d30bee00ac7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спорт. устройство, позволяющее в лечебных целях или для общей физической подготовки обеспечить человеку большую физическую нагрузку на весь организм или на отдельные группы мышц"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9802b7ad-48d0-483f-bba0-d0b739af8fb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "2605fdc2-8b47-3316-a596-d30bee00ac7f",
                        "source_sense_description": "учебное утройство для тренажа, то есть для выработки навыков управления какой-либо машиной",
                        "target_lang_word": "trainer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trainer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd3433c6-ca53-3ffd-8a39-a26cdc0ce3ea",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who trains another; a coach."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d75ca5b5-a88b-4bde-8428-139efebfb3f2",
                                                "sense_id": "cd3433c6-ca53-3ffd-8a39-a26cdc0ce3ea",
                                                "text": "It was [Roger] Federer’s ability to pull him around the court that put the lactic acid and debilitating weight in those legs and he should not have been allowed the luxury of his trainer’s help."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd472512-4aa7-398c-8e2f-090dddda617a",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person responsible for treating injuries sustained by players during matches; a physiotherapist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58b9c573-4e05-4e4c-83a2-6a655a09e381",
                                                "sense_id": "bd472512-4aa7-398c-8e2f-090dddda617a",
                                                "text": "He served Nelson wholeheartedly as a player, coach and trainer in a lengthy association, the highlights being his involvement in two championship-winning sides."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd887323-07f8-3019-95d9-58e2e79e7f44",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A running shoe or sneaker."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88fe6bc5-99d2-3681-8dee-d43575325566",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A patch for a video game that applies cheats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac3f2064-9587-417d-9a5d-023d24008805",
                                                "sense_id": "88fe6bc5-99d2-3681-8dee-d43575325566",
                                                "text": "I actually never got a trainer for RCT, but needed one for my brother when I installed it on his computer. He is 10, and is only concerned with making \"cool\" coasters. I also completed CF before getting trainers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d9074bb-615b-46f0-b082-a8cddba31117",
                                                "sense_id": "88fe6bc5-99d2-3681-8dee-d43575325566",
                                                "text": "Are there any sites that have original copies of games? (ie: Summer/Winter/World Games with Fast Loading). Just looking for games without the trainers/intros."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e267b37b-d49c-384b-b257-75fc8d9c1c90",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of indoor equipment allowing a bicycle to be ridden while stationary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1402941e-504a-33df-97fe-51f499c34001",
                                        "entry_id": "c2075f84-ea2d-3751-9b2d-64d3ea2b0731",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Attributive form of trainers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4831bb9f-34e4-44cd-81fa-0472f297543a",
                                                "sense_id": "1402941e-504a-33df-97fe-51f499c34001",
                                                "text": "There was chewing gum stuck to my trainer soles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cef34d9-cba5-447a-9d24-561a5f7a07ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "2605fdc2-8b47-3316-a596-d30bee00ac7f",
                        "source_sense_description": "учебное утройство для тренажа, то есть для выработки навыков управления какой-либо машиной",
                        "target_lang_word": "simulator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91a06e4f-2be8-39bb-8259-48d2b8b11a54",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who simulates or feigns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "193fecee-e117-4bac-a158-705a58dcb036",
                                                "sense_id": "91a06e4f-2be8-39bb-8259-48d2b8b11a54",
                                                "text": "Even confessing to a crime, the man may be mad, or a knavish simulator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine or system that simulates an environment (such as an aircraft cockpit), often for training purposes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af725404-b168-41d9-a20d-c3d18730ec5d",
                                                "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                                "text": "The dummy rocket is being developed to permit the ground testing of missile controls. By the use of this “flight simulator” the control devices of missiles can be subjected to operational tests on the ground, thus reducing the need for expensive flight tests."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa5285f7-d58c-47af-a6c3-7c833a8deb4e",
                                                "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                                "text": "Classroom sessions for drivers are under way, with each driver requiring a full day on the simulator before they then test a tram on the £350 million new line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game that attempts to reproduce an experience realistically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dc7c09a-6625-4545-ac5b-fc99f268379b",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                                "text": "a pinball simulator"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcc21584-52ab-4a7d-a5b5-53f1b8d5f944",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                                "text": "While writing for Mastertronic, David had seen that sales figures were much better for 'simulators' compared to less realistic games […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30c8c0f4-c8f4-4ffd-89d4-17df2fe96127",
                        "source_entry_id": "2605fdc2-8b47-3316-a596-d30bee00ac7f",
                        "source_sense_description": "учебное утройство для тренажа, то есть для выработки навыков управления какой-либо машиной",
                        "target_lang_word": "simulador",
